{"id":"33e3bd9a5bf15557","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-n-equivalence.md","title":"n-等价","display":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-n-equivalence","aliases":["29-df-n-equivalence"],"display":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 6.9, pp.94–95, DjVu scans 109–110","source_basis":"原书量词秩片段的等价接口已与文本层核对；本条限定为空初始变量位置的句子等价"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-n-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-n-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 6.9, pp.94–95, DjVu scans 109–110"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书量词秩片段的等价接口已与文本层核对；本条限定为空初始变量位置的句子等价"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-n-equivalence-—-n-等价-$\\equiv_n$\">df-n-equivalence — n-等价 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为同词汇的非空有限结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> 和满足关系见所列依赖；句子的真值不需要另外指定自由变量赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_nB\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\to(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_nB\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\to(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.9，印刷页94–95、扫描页109–110。此处比较量词秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的闭句，和带初始赋值的公式等价区分。定义允许有限词汇中出现函数；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a> 的游戏刻画另有限关系词汇前提，不因本条定义域较大而自动推广。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-n-equivalence-—-n-等价-$\\equiv_n$","text":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价 $\\equiv_n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 6.9，印刷页94–95、扫描页109–110。此处比较量词秩至多 $n$ 的闭句，和带初始赋值的公式等价区分。定义允许有限词汇中出现函数；[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]] 的游戏刻画另有限关系词汇前提，不因本条定义域较大而自动推广。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_nB\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\to(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi)).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1321,"backlinks":[{"id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_n$ (see [[29-df-n-equivalence]])"},{"id":"07c3669c44551902","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ and $\\equiv_k$ (see [[29-df-n-equivalence]])"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-n-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","3ee556c64b16809b","5a04c13fd73e2c1c","711217f22972ffc0","28e86a5f0243a0ae","0539a14219495918"]}